---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service - StudyGenie" description="StudyGenie terms of service. Understand the terms and conditions for using our AI-powered study tools.">

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">

    <!-- Back Link -->
    <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium mb-8 no-underline" style="color: #6366f1;">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
      Back to Home
    </a>

    <!-- Header -->
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm mb-10" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Last updated: January 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-8">

      <!-- Intro -->
      <section>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text);">
            Welcome to StudyGenie. By accessing or using our website and AI-powered study tools, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our services.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Service Description -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">1. Description of Service</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            StudyGenie provides AI-powered study tools including text summarization, flashcard generation, quiz creation, topic explanation, and YouTube video summarization. These tools use Google's Gemini AI to process text and generate educational content. The service is provided "as is" and is intended to be a supplementary study aid.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Not Educational Advice -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">2. Not Professional Educational Advice</h2>
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">
            <strong>StudyGenie is a study aid, not a substitute for professional education, tutoring, or academic guidance.</strong>
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-2" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #f59e0b; flex-shrink: 0;">⚠</span>
              <span>AI-generated summaries, flashcards, quizzes, and explanations may contain errors or inaccuracies.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #f59e0b; flex-shrink: 0;">⚠</span>
              <span>Always verify important information with your textbooks, teachers, or official course materials.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #f59e0b; flex-shrink: 0;">⚠</span>
              <span>Do not rely solely on StudyGenie for exam preparation or academic decisions.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #f59e0b; flex-shrink: 0;">⚠</span>
              <span>StudyGenie does not guarantee academic results or grades.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- AI Limitations -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">3. AI Limitations &amp; Disclaimer</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            StudyGenie uses artificial intelligence (Google's Gemini model) to generate content. While AI technology is powerful, it has inherent limitations:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-2" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span><strong style="color: var(--text);">Accuracy</strong> — AI may produce incorrect, incomplete, or misleading information. Always cross-check facts.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span><strong style="color: var(--text);">Hallucinations</strong> — AI models can generate plausible-sounding but factually incorrect content.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span><strong style="color: var(--text);">Bias</strong> — AI outputs may reflect biases present in training data.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span><strong style="color: var(--text);">Context</strong> — AI may misinterpret the context or nuance of specialized subject matter.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm mt-3" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            We are not responsible for any errors in AI-generated content or any consequences resulting from the use of such content.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Usage Limits -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">4. Usage Limits</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            To ensure fair access for all users, the following usage limits apply:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-2" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #10b981; flex-shrink: 0;">✓</span>
              <span><strong style="color: var(--text);">Free tier</strong> — 5 AI generations per day across all tools. Resets daily at midnight.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #10b981; flex-shrink: 0;">✓</span>
              <span><strong style="color: var(--text);">Input limits</strong> — Text input is limited to 8,000–10,000 characters per request depending on the tool.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #10b981; flex-shrink: 0;">✓</span>
              <span><strong style="color: var(--text);">API key</strong> — Users must provide their own Gemini API key. You are responsible for your API key usage and any associated costs from Google.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm mt-3" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            We reserve the right to modify usage limits at any time. Abuse of the service (automated scraping, excessive API calls, etc.) may result in access being restricted.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- User Responsibilities -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">5. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3" style="color: var(--text-muted);">By using StudyGenie, you agree to:</p>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-2" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span>Use the service only for lawful educational purposes.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span>Not use the service to generate content that is harmful, offensive, or violates any laws.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span>Not attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or abuse the service.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span>Not use automated bots or scripts to access the service.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span>Keep your API key secure and not share it publicly.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span style="color: #6366f1; flex-shrink: 0;">•</span>
              <span>Not submit copyrighted content that you do not have the right to use.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Intellectual Property -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            The StudyGenie name, logo, design, and code are the property of StudyGenie. The AI-generated content produced by the tools is provided for your personal educational use. You are free to use, copy, and share the AI-generated output for your own study purposes. You retain ownership of any text you input into the tools.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Limitation of Liability -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            StudyGenie is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without any warranties, express or implied. To the fullest extent permitted by law, StudyGenie shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits, data, or academic outcomes arising from your use of the service.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Third-Party Services -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">8. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            StudyGenie relies on Google's Gemini API for AI processing. Your use of the Gemini API through StudyGenie is also subject to <a href="https://ai.google.dev/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #6366f1; font-weight: 600;">Google's Terms of Service</a>. We are not responsible for any changes, downtime, or issues with third-party services.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Changes -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--text);">10. Contact Us</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3">
            <a href="mailto:hello@studygenie.in" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
              hello@studygenie.in
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

  </div>

</Layout>
